sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant C as KafkaCountdownClient
  participant B as Kafka broker
  participant A as CountdownKafkaAgent
  participant AU as AuditEventConsumer

  Note over C,AU: a2a-kafka POC — orange = Kafka carries all A2A wire traffic

  rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
    Note right of A: Optional discovery topic
    A->>B: produce a2a.agent-cards
    C->>B: consume agent-card
  end

  rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note right of C: Kafka replaces SendMessage RPC
    C->>B: produce a2a.requests (message/send)
    B->>A: consume request
  end

  rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note right of A: Kafka replaces SSE, push, and GetTask
    loop Countdown ticks
      A->>B: produce a2a.updates (status-update)
      B->>C: consume update
      B->>AU: consume update (audit group)
    end
    A->>B: produce artifact-update
    B->>C: consume artifact
    A->>B: produce task completed
    B->>C: consume final task
  end

  Note over C,A: JSON-RPC envelopes on Kafka topics<br/>Client and agent are both producers and consumers
